0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/933/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/566433105", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/933#issuecomment-566433105", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/933", "id": 566433105, "node_id": "MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU2NjQzMzEwNQ==", "user": {"login": "irsdkv", "id": 13483534, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDgzNTM0", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13483534?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv", "html_url": "https://github.com/irsdkv", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2019-12-17T08:15:43Z", "updated_at": "2019-12-17T08:15:43Z", "body": "I think that it will be ok to disable it by default if this annoying message occurs always.\r\nPlease let me some time to fix tymesync algorithm to prevent it.", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/566433105/reactions", "total_count": 1, "+1": 1, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/566495520", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/933#issuecomment-566495520", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/933", "id": 566495520, "node_id": "MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU2NjQ5NTUyMA==", "user": {"login": "irsdkv", "id": 13483534, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDgzNTM0", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13483534?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv", "html_url": "https://github.com/irsdkv", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2019-12-17T11:08:07Z", "updated_at": "2019-12-17T11:25:06Z", "body": "That's what I found:\r\n\r\nOn my hardware (Pixhawk 4) timesync works ok:\r\n1. What I do:\r\n1.0. Modify `master` Firmware to log hitting in [this line](https://github.com/PX4/Firmware/blob/07d656e971a72d1202651dfd3b4642736fb078d7/src/modules/mavlink/mavlink_timesync.cpp#L101)\r\n1.1. Upload Firmware on Pixhawk 4\r\n1.2. Connect with FMU Debug port to system console\r\n1.3. Start MAVSDK server\r\n1.4. Start `TIMESYNC` stream (in my case on ttyS2) on Pixhawk: `mavlink stream -d /dev/ttyS2 -s TIMESYNC -r 2`\r\n2. What I received on System console:\r\n2.1. Sometimes `High RTT` [this line](https://github.com/PX4/Firmware/blob/07d656e971a72d1202651dfd3b4642736fb078d7/src/modules/mavlink/mavlink_timesync.cpp#L133) (that's ok).\r\n2.2. My log msg (so adjusting goes normally).\r\n\r\nSo seems that in my case all worked ok. But on some systems `system_time` subsystem may work different.\r\n\r\nI think that this can be fixed with [this PR](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/pull/934).\r\nPlease try to build Server with it and let me know what happens.\r\n", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/566495520/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/566644452", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/933#issuecomment-566644452", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/933", "id": 566644452, "node_id": "MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU2NjY0NDQ1Mg==", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2019-12-17T16:39:02Z", "updated_at": "2019-12-17T16:39:02Z", "body": "Hm, maybe the problem is because I'm using `PX4_SIM_SPEED_FACTOR=20 make px4_sitl gazebo` saw the time on the PX4 side runs 20 times faster.", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/566644452/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/566645292", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/933#issuecomment-566645292", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/933", "id": 566645292, "node_id": "MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU2NjY0NTI5Mg==", "user": {"login": "fnoop", "id": 8210968, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjgyMTA5Njg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8210968?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/fnoop", "html_url": "https://github.com/fnoop", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/fnoop/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/fnoop/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/fnoop/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/fnoop/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/fnoop/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/fnoop/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/fnoop/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/fnoop/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/fnoop/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2019-12-17T16:41:07Z", "updated_at": "2019-12-17T16:42:53Z", "body": "If you've got a system timesync running (ntpd, chronyd, systemd-timesyncd), whenever they adjust the system clock you will probably get this error.\r\n\r\nAny timesync mechanism between devices should use a monotonic clock, and should be immune to wall-clock changes?", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/566645292/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/567407829", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/933#issuecomment-567407829", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/933", "id": 567407829, "node_id": "MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU2NzQwNzgyOQ==", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2019-12-19T09:25:08Z", "updated_at": "2019-12-19T09:25:08Z", "body": "@fnoop that makes sense.\