, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDgzNTM0", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13483534?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv", "html_url": "https://github.com/irsdkv", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2019-12-17T08:15:43Z", "updated_at": "2019-12-17T08:15:43Z", "body": "I think that it will be ok to disable it by default if this annoying message occurs always.\r\nPlease let me some time to fix tymesync algorithm to prevent it.", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/566433105/reactions", "total_count": 1, "+1": 1, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null, "event": "commented", "actor": {"login": "irsdkv", "id": 13483534, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDgzNTM0", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13483534?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv", "html_url": "https://github.com/irsdkv", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/566495520", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/933#issuecomment-566495520", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/933", "id": 566495520, "node_id": "MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU2NjQ5NTUyMA==", "user": {"login": "irsdkv", "id": 13483534, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDgzNTM0", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13483534?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv", "html_url": "https://github.com/irsdkv", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2019-12-17T11:08:07Z", "updated_at": "2019-12-17T11:25:06Z", "body": "That's what I found:\r\n\r\nOn my hardware (Pixhawk 4) timesync works ok:\r\n1. What I do:\r\n1.0. Modify `master` Firmware to log hitting in [this line](https://github.com/PX4/Firmware/blob/07d656e971a72d1202651dfd3b4642736fb078d7/src/modules/mavlink/mavlink_timesync.cpp#L101)\r\n1.1. Upload Firmware on Pixhawk 4\r\n1.2. Connect with FMU Debug port to system console\r\n1.3. Start MAVSDK server\r\n1.4. Start `TIMESYNC` stream (in my case on ttyS2) on Pixhawk: `mavlink stream -d /dev/ttyS2 -s TIMESYNC -r 2`\r\n2. What I received on System console:\r\n2.1. Sometimes `High RTT` [this line](https://github.com/PX4/Firmware/blob/07d656e971a72d1202651dfd3b4642736fb078d7/src/modules/mavlink/mavlink_timesync.cpp#L133) (that's ok).\r\n2.2. My log msg (so adjusting goes normally).\r\n\r\nSo seems that in my case all worked ok. But on some systems `system_time` subsystem may work different.\r\n\r\nI think that this can be fixed with [this PR](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/pull/934).\r\nPlease try to build Server with it and let me know what happens.\r\n", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/566495520/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null, "event": "commented", "actor": {"login": "irsdkv", "id": 13483534, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDgzNTM0", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13483534?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv", "html_url": "https://github.com/irsdkv", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/irsdkv/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/